andard Specification for Aggregate for Masonry Mortar</RTL><BRK/><BRK/><RID>ASTM C150/C150M</RID><RTL>(2024) Standard Specification for Portland Cement</RTL><BRK/><BRK/><RID>ASTM C159</RID><RTL>(2006; R 2021) Standard Specification for Vitrified Clay Filter Blocks</RTL><BRK/><BRK/><RID>ASTM C700</RID><RTL>(2018; R 2022) Standard Specification for Vitrified Clay Pipe, Extra Strength, Standard Strength, and Perforated</RTL><BRK/><BRK/><RID>ASTM C1107/C1107M</RID><RTL>(2020) Standard Specification for Packaged Dry, Hydraulic-Cement Grout (Nonshrink)</RTL><BRK/><BRK/></REF><REF><ORG>SOCIETY FOR PROTECTIVE COATINGS (SSPC)</ORG><BRK/><BRK/><RID>SSPC SP 8</RID><RTL>(2025) Pickling</RTL><BRK/><BRK/></REF></SPT><SPT><TTL>SUBMITTALS</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
